<title>USA: Johnston names David Chandler interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Johnston names David Chandler interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ga. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnston Industries Inc said on Monday its chairman, David Chandler, will serve as interim president and chief executive until a successor is found for Gerald Andrews, who is retiring.</p>
<p>Chandler previously served as Johnston's chief executive from 1990 through 1995.</p>
<p>Johnston makes textile fabrics.</p>
